  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0477.adelon_dramaton.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0477.adelon_dramaton.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0477.adelon_dramaton.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0477_adelon_dramaton"><head>ΑΔΗΛΩΝ ΔΡΑΜΑΤΩΝ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" xml:id="kock-0477-adelon_dramaton-4" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0477_adelon_dramaton">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0477-adelon_dramaton-4-l1" xml:lang="grc">ὡς ὁ μὲν κλέπτης, ὁ δ’ ἅρπαξ,</l>
                <l n="2" xml:id="kock-0477-adelon_dramaton-4-l2" xml:lang="grc">ὁ δ’ ἀνάπηρος πορνοβοσκός</l>
                <l n="3" xml:id="kock-0477-adelon_dramaton-4-l3" xml:lang="grc">καταφαγᾶς.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">
                <p>Phrynichus Epit. 433 usum vocis καταφαγᾶς inprobans ἴσως δ’ ἂν εἴποις, ὅτι ἠκολούθησα Μυρτίλῳ λέγοντι· ὡς κτλ. ἀλλ’ οὐκ ἐχρῆν τὰς ἅπαξ εἰρημένας λέξεις ἁρπάζειν. Pollux 6, 40 παμπόνηρος δὲ ὁ παρὰ τῷ Μυρτίλῳ τῷ κωμικῷ καταφαγᾶς.</p>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">
                <p>cf. Lobeck. 437. Cratin. 451. Aristoph. Av. 288. 9. Herodian. I 51, 8 ἐπὶ σκώμματος τασσόμενα φαγᾶς, καταφαγᾶς. cf. II 657, 13. ὡς] ὧν Lobeck.</p>
              </note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>
